  "text": "STORE\nCOMMUNITY\nABOUT\nSUPPORT\nInstall Steam sign in  |  language\nBrowse\nRecommendations\nCategories\nHardware\nWays to Play\nSpecial Sections\nMore\nAdvanced Search\nAll Games > Free To Play Games > [WoG] War of Genesis: Idle Loot\nCommunity Hub\n[WoG] War of Genesis: Idle Loot\nJust leave it running. The rest takes care of itself. In a small corner of your desktop, a 3D character fights and loots all on its own. Snag good gear and trade it on the Steam Community Market. It's idle, yet you can't stop watching. Addictive looting at its finest.\nALL REVIEWS:\nMixed (1,727)\nRELEASE DATE:\nOct 7, 2026\nDEVELOPER:\nNew Normal Soft Inc.\nPUBLISHER:\nNew Normal Soft Inc.\nPopular user-defined tags for this product:\nDesktop CompanionIdlerTradingRPGFree to Play+\n\nSign in to add this item to your wishlist, follow it, or mark it as ignored\n\nSingle-player\nOnline PvP\nSteam Achievements\nIn-App Purchases\nFamily Sharing\nRequires agreement to a 3rd-party EULA\nWar of Genesis: Idle Loot EULA\nLanguages:\n\tInterface\tFull Audio\tSubtitles\nEnglish\t✔\t\t\nKorean\t✔\t\t\nFrench\t✔\t\t\nItalian\t✔\t\t\nGerman\t✔\t\t\nSee all 17 supported languages\nContent\nIncludes Interactive Elements\n\nIn-game purchases, In-game chat, Online interactivity\n\nTITLE: [WoG] War of Genesis: Idle Loot\nGENRE: Action, Casual, RPG, Free To Play\n\nDEVELOPER: New Normal Soft Inc.\nPUBLISHER: New Normal Soft Inc.\nRELEASE DATE: Oct 7, 2026\nEARLY ACCESS RELEASE DATE: Sep 10, 2026\n\nView update history\nRead related news\nView discussions\nFind Community Groups\nEmbed\n \n \nPlay [WoG] War of Genesis: Idle Loot\nFree To Play \nPlay Game\n \nAbout This Game\n\nA personal mini-battlefield right on your desktop.\n\nNo clunky game windows, no cluttered background maps.\n\nWar of Genesis: Idle Loot is an idle loot RPG with a transparent background that runs smoothly in a small corner of your screen.\n\nA 3D hero sets up camp on your desktop, battling tirelessly by your side no matter what you're doing.\n\n\nJust leave it running, and it gets stronger on its own.\n\nNo controls required.\n\nWhether you're working or sleeping, your hero's growth never stops.\n\nTrade acquired loot on the Steam Community Market.\n\nItems you loot can be traded with other players on the Market.\n\nExperience the thrill of trading your hard-earned spoils and filling up your Steam Wallet.\n\nThe real fun is in the loot drops.\n\nAs you run stages, gear pours in.\n\nWeapons, armor, and even gems!\n\nBuild your own powerful setup through endless item farming.\n\nJoin an Alliance and grow together.\n\nTeam up with alliance members to tackle powerful bosses in Alliance Raids.\n\nMultiplayer action with players worldwide.\n\nChallenge global players in World Boss battles, test your hero's might in the PvP Arena, and chat with the community.\n\nWatch your hero grow automatically, trade looted gear on the Market, and compete with players across the globe.\n\nWar of Genesis: Idle Loot. Right now, on your desktop.\n\nSystem Requirements\nMINIMUM:\n\nRequires a 64-bit processor and operating system\n\nOS: Windows 10 (64-Bit)\n\nPROCESSOR: Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200\n\nMEMORY: 8 GB RAM\n\nGRAPHICS: GeForce GT 1030 / Intel Iris Xe / Radeon Vega 8 or better (DirectX 11 compatible)\n\nDIRECTX: Version 11\n\nNETWORK: Broadband Internet connection\n\nSTORAGE: 3 GB available space\nRECOMMENDED:\n\nRequires a 64-bit processor and operating system\n\nOS: Windows 11 (64-Bit)\n\nPROCESSOR: Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600\n\nMEMORY: 16 GB RAM\n\nGRAPHICS: GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / GTX 1650 / Radeon RX 560 or better\n\nDIRECTX: Version 11\n\nNETWORK: Broadband Internet connection\n\nSTORAGE: 3 GB available space\nView all\nWhat Curators Say\n14 Curators have reviewed this product. Click here to see them.",
